 Welcome to Podar College 
 
 Run by the Anandilal Podar Trust , Seth Gyaniram Bansidhar Podar College, Nawalgarh is one of the
 premier educational institutions in the Shekhawati region of Rajasthan. The College inherits a rich
 legacy of nation-builders and philanthropists and continues to foster an academic environment grounded
 in values, research, and community impact.
 
 
 Beginning as a Brahmacharya Ashram in 1921 and upgraded to a High School in 1930, the institution grew
 into a leading college offering UG & PG programmes with a reputation for academic excellence,
 industry exposure, and holistic development.
 

